<title>USA: Morgan Group to buy back up to 100,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Morgan Group to buy back up to 100,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE, Md. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Morgan Group said Monday that it has authorized the company to repurchase up to an additional 100,000 of its class A common shares.</p>
<p>The company also said that it has completed the purchase of about 125,000 shares of the previously announced buy-back of 150,000 shares, and that further purchases are expected this year.</p>
<p>Morgan said that it believes its stock to be undervalued and that the share repurchases will build greater shareholder value.</p>
</text>
